Hey, this is Clark Green, and welcome to the Scoutmaster Podcast.

8
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:45,700
Hey, it's just me.

9
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,700
This is Podcast number 34.

10
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:19,500
Welcome back to the Scoutmaster Podcast.

11
00:01:20,160 --> 00:01:21,500
This is Tim the Enchanter.

12
