Now, this is Clark Green.

13
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:29,339
I want to reach out to somebody who is a frequent commenter on the blog, Larry Geiger.

14
00:01:29,539 --> 00:01:34,580
Larry, you know, you have a lot of great input, and I really appreciate it.

15
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:36,699
And I just wanted to mention that.

16
00:01:37,179 --> 00:01:42,220
Larry was kind of tickled with the interview I did last week with one of our den chiefs.

17
00:01:42,220 --> 00:01:47,920
He said, you know, the question I asked was, has being a den chief been aggravating?

18
